    ],
    "text": "PARLIAMENTARY ELECTIONS ACT, No. 1 OF 1981",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0,
      10.440306663513184
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      187.29,
      343.69,
      400.43,
      354.76
    ],
    "text": "Filling of a Vacancy under Section 64 (5)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.440306663513184
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      367.69,
      539.93,
      426.76
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the Secretary General of Parliament has informed me, under Section 64 (5) of the Parliamentary Elections Act,No. 1 of 1981, as amended by Section 6 of the Elections (Special Provisions) Act, No. 35 of 1988, that a vancancy has occurredin the Membership of the Seventh Parliament by reason of the resignation of Mr. A. H. M. Aswar being a member nominatedby the United People's Freedom Alliance, a recognized political party, and declared elected as a Member of Parliament underArticle 99A of the Constitution ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      439.69,
      539.89,
      462.76
    ],
    "text": "And whereas the Secretary of that Political Party was required by me under the aforesaid section to nominate aneligible person to fill such vacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      475.69,
      539.87,
      498.76
    ],
    "text": "And whereas the Secretary of the aforesaid Political Party has nominated Mr. Ameer Ali Shihabdeen to fill suchvacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      511.69,
      539.95,
      546.76
    ],
    "text": "Now therefore, I, Mahinda Deshapriya, Commissioner of Elections, in the exercise of the powers conferred on me bySection 64 (5) of the Parliamentary Elections Act, No. 1 of 1981, do hereby declare Mr. Ameer Ali Shihabdeen elected as amember of the Seventh Parliament to fill the vacancy caused by the resignation of aforesaid Mr. A. H. M. Aswar.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      559.69,
      520.55,
      618.76
    ],
    "text": "MAHINDA DESHAPRIYA,Commissioner of Elections.Election Secretariat,Rajagiriya,09th December 2014.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.800000190734863,
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
